OL,3,AMiliband says he won't resign if
OL,4,Agovernment approves Rosebank oil field
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Miliband said he will "definitely
OL,7,Fnot" resign if the government approves
OL,8,Fthe Rosebank oil field, despite
OL,9,Fpreviously calling the scheme "climate
OL,10,Fvandalism".
OL,12,FThe foreign secretary told the BBC he
OL,13,Fwould "obey collective responsibility",
OL,14,Fwhich requires ministers to publicly
OL,15,Fsupport decisions made by the
OL,16,Fgovernment even if they disagree with
OL,17,Fthem.
OL,19,FA decision on the future of the oil
OL,20,Ffield off Shetland will be taken by
OL,21,FMiatta Fahnbulleh, who succeeded
OL,22,FMiliband as energy secretary in July.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
