OL,3,AMiliband says he won't resign if
OL,4,Agovernment approves Rosebank oil field
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome Labour MPs oppose the project,
OL,7,Fwhile the Conservatives argue there is
OL,8,Fa need to "get Britain drilling".
OL,9,FMiliband publicly raised his concerns
OL,10,Fabout Rosebank while Labour was in
OL,11,Fopposition.
